_exptl_absorpt_process_details
; 
empirical absobtion correction by SADABS 2.1. 
SADABS is run with 0.002 as restraint to the scale factor esd and 
1/4 as orders of spherical harmonics. R(int) drops from 7.23% to 3.98%. The 
scale factor is between 1.15 and 0.85. In the best error model factor g was 
0.0488 and was once refinded manually. All five runs are 
similar in R(int) and k 
factor. The transmission ratio is 0.671276  and a spherical 
absorbtion correctio 
is not applied.  Theoretical values for minimum and maximum transmission based 
on the size of the crystal are 0.9724 and 0.9910. 
;
